<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>blindspot</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Charlotte Sands</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">can we start over?</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">0SqZvFpQbApABMTzwQ4rXh</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:03.630" end="00:07.630">You bite your nails when you're nervous</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:07.630" end="00:15.290">You keep your lighter in your bottom drawer</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.290" end="00:19.690">Your laugh has like two different versions</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.690" end="00:25.280">Yeah, it changes when you're insecure</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.280" end="00:28.080">And I know that you cry</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.080" end="00:30.520">Watching certain movies</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.520" end="00:33.870">Why do I stay by your side</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.870" end="00:36.320">When you never choose me?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.320" end="00:41.870">I wish I could have you all to myself</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.870" end="00:47.990">I wouldn't have to share you with everyone else</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.990" end="00:53.840">Why can't you be mine for a minute, babe?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.840" end="00:59.090">Maybe I would have you all to myself</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.090" end="01:07.090">If I was anyone else</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.590" end="01:12.040">I hate when you say that I'm so different</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.040" end="01:18.980">From the other girls you've had before</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.980" end="01:23.670">If that's true, I'm confused, what am I missing?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.670" end="01:29.130">I could be like them a little more</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.130" end="01:32.010">Did you know that I cried</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.010" end="01:34.580">When you called her perfect?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.580" end="01:37.830">I always laugh and I lie</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.830" end="01:40.370">But under the surface</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.370" end="01:45.830">I wish I could have you all to myself</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.830" end="01:51.780">I wouldn't have to share you with everyone else</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.780" end="01:57.670">Why can't you be mine for a minute, babe?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.670" end="02:03.140">Maybe I would have you all to myself</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.140" end="02:08.910">If I was anyone else</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.910" end="02:11.960" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(If I was anyone else)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.960" end="02:14.510">I'm on the sideline</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.510" end="02:17.610">Watching as you're falling for her</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.610" end="02:19.110">And it's about time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.740" end="02:20.290" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(And it's about time)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.290" end="02:23.450">Where you come running back 'cause you got hurt</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.450" end="02:26.230">I'm in your blind spot</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.230" end="02:28.710">Waiting in the dark, is it my turn?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.710" end="02:33.010">Or am I stuck here standing in line?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.010" end="02:38.100">I wish I could have you all to myself</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.100" end="02:44.350">I wouldn't have to share you with everyone else</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:44.350" end="02:50.200">Why can't you be mine for a minute, babe?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:50.200" end="02:55.950">Maybe I would have you all to myself</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:55.950" end="02:58.980">All to myself</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:58.980" end="03:02.500">All to myself</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:02.500" end="03:07.840">I wish I could have you all to myself (I'm on the sideline)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:07.840" end="03:13.090" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Did you know that I cried?)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:13.090" end="03:16.740">I wouldn't have to share you with everyone else</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:16.740" end="03:18.540">I'm in your blind spot</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:18.540" end="03:20.040">Waiting in the dark, is it my turn?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:19.260" end="03:24.570">Maybe I would have you all to myself</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:24.570" end="03:28.570">If I was anyone else</p></div></body></tt>